OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 1970, Washoe the chimp was
OL,14,     Frecognised as the first non-human
OL,15,     Fto learn a human language. She was
OL,16,     Ftaught American sign language in a
OL,17,     Frevolutionary and controversial
OL,18,     Fexperiment.
